{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion with the scvi_n200 RNA encoder and ResNet50 image encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5399 and F1 of 0.5245, slightly higher than the concat fusion baseline with scvi_n200 (experiment 003). The results suggest weighted fusion may offer marginal benefits over concat when using advanced RNA encoders, but the relative effectiveness of fusion strategies remains uncertain without direct comparison to other methods."
}

